  "abstract": "{\"capability_summary\":\"编辑卡券信息，只有deliver_start、deliver_end、global_limit、user_limit允许编辑，卡券开始后所有数据不允许修改，status字段控制卡券上下线。\",\"id\":\"clue.coupon.update\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/clue/coupon/update/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1696710639943692\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"clue.get_access_token\",\"path\":\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710506574848\",\"reason\":\"需要先获取授权access_token才能调用编辑卡券接口\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"},{\"id\":\"clue.return_code\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710760866831\",\"reason\":\"编辑卡券接口的返回码和返回信息需要参考此文档\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"附录-返回码\"}],\"risk_level\":\"medium\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1696710639943692\",\"supplemental_knowledge\":[],\"title\":\"编辑卡券\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-view qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ZwwByEfh\">编辑卡券接口。 只有deliver_start、deliver_end、global_limit、user_limit允许编辑。 卡券开始后，所有的数据都不允许修改。 status字段控制卡券的上下线，只支持：NORMAL：上线，OFFLINE：下线</p>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201774822524591117%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-kUUOpGYk\" id=\"link-0\">请求地址</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-DGM0kt1l\"><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/clue/coupon/update/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/clue/coupon/update/</span></a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1696710639943692\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-ZrVcRPWo\" id=\"link-1\">请求方法</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-cbbQUNcV\">POST</p><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-WfA59ZAv\" id=\"link-2\">Header</h3><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"ta24e858-Gc0p0YqS\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"wi